    },
    {
      "text": "４ー５ターンの　あいだ　あいてに\nまとわりついて　こうげきする。\nそのあいだ　あいては　にげられない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "4-5턴 동안 상대에게\n엉겨붙어 공격한다.\n그동안 상대는 도망갈 수 없다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attaque l’ennemi sans répit pendant quatre à cinq\ntours. Ce dernier ne peut pas fuir au cours de\ncette période.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender fällt 4 bis 5 Runden lang wie\neine Plage über das Ziel her und greift es an.\nIn diesem Zeitraum kann es nicht fliehen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una saca grande y resistente utilizada para\ntransportar el botín reunido en la mina de carbón.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa lancia un attacco che tormenta\nil bersaglio per quattro o cinque turni, durante\ni quali gli impedisce di fuggire.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The target is infested and attacked\nfor four to five turns.\nThe target can’t flee during this time.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "４ー５ターンの　間　相手に\nまとわりついて　攻撃する。\nその間　相手は　逃げられない。",
